{
  "info": {
    "name": "ClientHub API",
    "description": "All 32 ClientHub REST endpoints. Run \"Auth > Login (admin)\" first: the session cookie is stored in the Postman cookie jar. Create requests save the new record id into collection variables (leadId, contactId, dealId, activityId, userId) so later requests work in order. To test RBAC, log in as a sales executive and try the admin-only Users folder (expect 403).",
